  data: {
    LLM: 'Pass your three worst cards in the first pass; avoid keeping unconnected high cards. Discard the two that least help your five-card hand.\n\nTrack which cards you passed and to whom; infer what neighbours might have. Order your five cards to reveal strong cards early to lead betting when you have the high hand showing.\n\nBluff by passing strong cards to mislead the left neighbour; balance between improving your hand and hiding strength. In high-low variants, decide declaration based on passed and received cards.',
    Player: 'Pass your three worst cards in the first pass; avoid keeping unconnected high cards. Discard the two that least help your five-card hand.\n\nTrack which cards you passed and to whom; infer what neighbours might have. Order your five cards to reveal strong cards early to lead betting when you have the high hand showing.\n\nBluff by passing strong cards to mislead the left neighbour; balance between improving your hand and hiding strength. In high-low variants, decide declaration based on passed and received cards.',
